# (build 131a) AC SLASHR's name is ten codes in the ROM, the last a space
# (`nametxt "AC SLASHR "`, ps2.asm:28392), and Script_ProcessItemEnemyNames
# copies up to ten, stopping only at $C4: the weapon store's "{item}...ok."
# prints "AC SLASHR ...ok.". The extractor stripped the space until 131a,
# so the port printed "AC SLASHR...ok." (build 131's round-trip found the
# item table a byte out). Aukba's weapon store (store 18), the fourth item.
start building 5 13 5 18
wait idle
press down
press down
press down
press c
wait idle
expect text "AC SLASHR {47}{47}{47}ok."
shot 01_ac_slasher
